# Dockerfile and compose.yaml are deliberately NOT ignored (AS-26): the image
# COPYs them in as DATA for test/deploy-shape.test.js, which asserts that the
# compose mounts actually cover what CHAT_REPO_ROOT + /api/file must serve.
# Nothing at runtime reads them.
#
# AS-86: this file no longer excludes ITSELF, and that is load-bearing. It is
# an image input (it shapes what every COPY above actually copies), so the
# Dockerfile COPYs it in as data too — a self-exclusion would fail that COPY
# with "file not found in build context", and deploy-shape.test.js could not
# read it in the mountless runner to assert it hides no input.
